### Generate pre-signed URL for S3 file
### This endpoint generates a pre-signed URL for accessing files stored in S3
### The URL expiration time is configured via environment variable (S3_PRESIGNED_URL_EXPIRATION_HOURS)
### Default: 24 hours
GET http://localhost:29000/api/v1/users/s3/presigned-url?fileKey=jsons/cities/CC.json
Content-Type: application/json

### Example Response:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "message": "Pre-signed URL generated successfully",
###   "data": {
###     "fileKey": "jsons/cities/CC.json",
###     "presignedUrl": "https://s3.ru-7.storage.selcloud.ru/boostx-storage/jsons/cities/CC.json?X-Amz-Algorithm=...",
###     "expirationHours": 24
###   },
###   "timestamp": "2025-11-25T04:30:00"
### }

###

### Generate pre-signed URL for another city file
GET http://localhost:29000/api/v1/users/s3/presigned-url?fileKey=jsons/cities/CD.json
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Generate pre-signed URL for user avatar
GET http://localhost:29000/api/v1/users/s3/presigned-url?fileKey=users/123/avatar.jpg
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Generate pre-signed URL for avatar file
GET http://localhost:29000/api/v1/users/s3/presigned-url?fileKey=avatars/user-456.png
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Example: File not found error
### GET http://localhost:29000/api/v1/users/s3/presigned-url?fileKey=non-existent/file.json
### Expected: 404 Not Found with error message
